# Normalize line endings so a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true) never mangles a Unix
# shebang. LocalStack's init runner execs infra/localstack/init/*.sh directly; a CRLF-corrupted
# shebang ("#!/bin/bash\r") fails with ENOENT misreported against the script path, not the
# interpreter — the fix is forcing these to LF at checkout, not a per-developer git config.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh text eol=lf
